```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />

    <title>Welcome to Power Connect</title>

    <style>
      body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
        background-color: #f4f7f9;
        color: #333333;
      }

      .container {
        max-width: 500px;
        margin: 40px auto;
        background-color: #ffffff;
        padding: 35px;
        border-radius: 10px;
        box-shadow: 0 3px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
      }

      .logo {
        text-align: center;
        margin-bottom: 25px;
      }

      .logo h1 {
        margin: 0;
        color: #2563eb;
        font-size: 28px;
      }

      .content h2 {
        color: #222222;
        margin-bottom: 15px;
      }

      .content p {
        font-size: 15px;
        line-height: 1.6;
        color: #555555;
      }

      .button {
        display: inline-block;
        margin: 20px 0;
        padding: 12px 24px;
        background-color: #2563eb;
        color: #ffffff !important;
        text-decoration: none;
        border-radius: 6px;
        font-weight: bold;
      }

      .footer {
        margin-top: 30px;
        padding-top: 20px;
        border-top: 1px solid #eeeeee;
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #999999;
      }
    </style>
  </head>

  <body>
    <div class="container">

      <div class="logo">
        <h1>Power Connect</h1>
      </div>

      <div class="content">
        <h2>Welcome, <%= name %>! 🎉</h2>

        <p>
          We're excited to have you join <strong>Power Connect</strong>.
        </p>

        <p>
          Your account has been successfully created and your email address
          has been verified.
        </p>

        <p>
          You can now log in to your account and start using Power Connect.
        </p>

       
        <p>
          If you have any questions or need assistance, feel free to contact
          our support team.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="footer">
        &copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Power Connect.
        All rights reserved.
      </div>

    </div>
  </body>
</html>
```
